{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":56,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["信靠上帝的祈禱"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["非利士人在迦特拿住大衛。那時，他作這金詩，交與伶長。調用遠方無聲鴿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，求你憐憫我，因為人要把我吞了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"終日攻擊欺壓我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仇敵終日要把我吞了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因逞驕傲攻擊我的人甚多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我懼怕的時候要倚靠你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我倚靠上帝，我要讚美他的話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我倚靠上帝，必不懼怕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"血氣之輩能把我怎麼樣呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"他們終日顛倒我的話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們一切的心思都是要害我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們聚集，埋伏窺探我的腳蹤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候要害我的命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們豈能因罪孽逃脫嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你在怒中使眾民墮落！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我幾次流離，你都記數；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你把我眼淚裝在你的皮袋裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這不都記在你冊子上嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼求的日子，我的仇敵都要轉身退後。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝幫助我，這是我所知道的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我倚靠上帝，我要讚美他的話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我倚靠耶和華，我要讚美他的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我倚靠上帝，必不懼怕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人能把我怎麼樣呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，我向你所許的願在我身上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將感謝祭獻給你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你救我的命脫離死亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你豈不是救護我的腳不跌倒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我在生命光中行在上帝面前嗎？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/56.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/57.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/55.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}